{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20030","headline":"赠李观 · 孟郊","name":"赠李观","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"谁言形影亲，灯灭影去身。\n谁言鱼水欢，水竭鱼枯鳞。\n昔爲同恨客，今爲独笑人。\n舍予在泥辙，飘迹上云津。\n卧木易成蠹，弃花难再春。\n何言对芳景，愁望极萧晨。\n埋劒谁识气，匣弦日生尘。\n愿君语高风，爲余问苍旻。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20030.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20030","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}